{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-64","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-64"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815232-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-64","missionId":"event-rogue-64","mission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","scene":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"또 갈색 머리 뻐꾸기 시계 애호가를 만났다! 당신을 발견한 그가 반갑게 인사해왔다. 당신은 그가 「검은 숲」 발굴자 동료와 막 통화를 마쳤다는 사실을 알아차렸다","talkId":403815232,"textHash":"4937749412210310486","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:64/talk-403815232","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"2d52f5f3b9091706","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815233-line"],"bwikiPage":"咕咕钟狂热粉丝（其二）","bwikiRevision":60530,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10323","bwikiMission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815233-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-64","missionId":"event-rogue-64","mission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","scene":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「또 만났네! 마침 뻐꾸기 시계 동호회를 만들 참이었어! 다른 뻐꾸기 시계의 매력도 느껴볼래?」 마음의 준비를 채 끝내기도 전에 그의 열정이 불쑥 찾아왔다","talkId":403815233,"textHash":"4797202892844279899","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:64/talk-403815233","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"2d52f5f3b9091706","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"咕咕钟狂热粉丝（其二）","bwikiRevision":60530,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10323","bwikiMission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-text-12106627932146484329-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-64","missionId":"event-rogue-64","mission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","scene":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"랜덤 뻐꾸기 시계 계열 디버프 기물 1개와 ★2 축복 1개를 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"12106627932146484329","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:64/text-12106627932146484329","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"301fdec32f809355","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815235-line"],"bwikiPage":"咕咕钟狂热粉丝（其二）","bwikiRevision":60530,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10323","bwikiMission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815235-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-64","missionId":"event-rogue-64","mission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","scene":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그렇게 또 뻐꾸기 시계를 얻었다! 이런 식이면 언젠간 뻐꾸기 시계 애호가의 길을 걷게 되는 건 아닐지 두려움이 들기 시작했다…","talkId":403815235,"textHash":"10032569368144506660","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:64/talk-403815235","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"301fdec32f809355","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"咕咕钟狂热粉丝（其二）","bwikiRevision":60530,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10323","bwikiMission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-text-543380491711302158-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-64","missionId":"event-rogue-64","mission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","scene":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"뻐꾸기 시계를 그에게 돌려준다","talkId":null,"textHash":"543380491711302158","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:64/text-543380491711302158","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"35e5daccc2c0d13c","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-text-11673283743625499011-effect"],"bwikiPage":"咕咕钟狂热粉丝（其二）","bwikiRevision":60530,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10323","bwikiMission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-text-11673283743625499011-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-64","missionId":"event-rogue-64","mission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","scene":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"모든 뻐꾸기 시계를 버린다","talkId":null,"textHash":"11673283743625499011","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:64/text-11673283743625499011","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"35e5daccc2c0d13c","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"咕咕钟狂热粉丝（其二）","bwikiRevision":60530,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10323","bwikiMission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-text-543380491711302158-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815237-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-64","missionId":"event-rogue-64","mission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","scene":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그는 매우 슬퍼했다. 뻐꾸기 시계의 유혹에 저항할 수 있는 사람이 있다는 걸 이해하지 못하는 듯했다","talkId":403815237,"textHash":"4311611391921629275","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:64/talk-403815237","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"600a78c78a6a2dff","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815238-line"],"bwikiPage":"咕咕钟狂热粉丝（其二）","bwikiRevision":60530,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10323","bwikiMission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815238-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-64","missionId":"event-rogue-64","mission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","scene":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그는 한숨을 내쉬며 떠났다","talkId":403815238,"textHash":"1108790712877859356","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:64/talk-403815238","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"600a78c78a6a2dff","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"咕咕钟狂热粉丝（其二）","bwikiRevision":60530,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-10323","bwikiMission":"뻐꾸기 시계의 광팬 (2)"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815232-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815233-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-text-12106627932146484329-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815235-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-text-543380491711302158-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-text-11673283743625499011-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815237-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-64-talk-403815238-line"],"bwiki":{"matc